9,Nachiring Language (NCD) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ncd/,Nachiring is an endangered indigenous language of Nepal. It belongs to the Sino-Tibetan language family. The language is used as a first language by some people in every generation of the ethnic community.,Nachiring,Sino-Tibetan
